-- Account — tenant identity: name, slug, and a free-form config record.
--
-- Static rows: none. Lives in a dedicated `accounts` SQL table (NOT
-- entity_instances) — registered here purely for the validation surface
-- (state:validateEntityInstance against POST/PUT bodies). Identity
-- (label / description / icon) is lifted from the directives below; the
-- auto-register loop in system-entities.ts registers the entity. The
-- pre-flip inline-TS `defineSystemEntity({ type: {…} })` is GONE.
--
-- FM-retire-E1 Step 6 — the inline-TS domain-record authoring port. The
-- id ships LOWERCASE (`@codeName "account"`) byte-for-byte (the
-- entity_type column / {$ref} refs); the PascalCase `Account` is the
-- parser-required type_def head (Step-2 Surprise #1).

@entity
@codeName "account"
@label "Account"
@description "Tenant identity — name, slug, and free-form config record"
@icon "users"
Account = Account name: String slug: String config: {}
